msgstr "RapidOCR 环境未安装, 请按文档创建 Python 虚拟环境."

#: src/ocr/engine.js:33
msgid "RapidOCR timed out. Select a smaller area or increase the timeout in Settings."
msgstr "RapidOCR 超时, 请缩小选区或在设置中调大超时时间."

#: src/ocr/engine.js:34
msgid "No text was recognized in the selection."
msgstr "选区内没有识别到文字."

#: src/ocr/engine.js:35
msgid "The screenshot file could not be read."
msgstr "无法读取截图文件."

#: src/ocr/engine.js:36
